  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LastSignal.Runtime::LastSignal.Interaction.NoteInteractable
  id: l4_report
  title: Fire marshal's preliminary report
  body: 'BROADCAST WING - PRELIMINARY


    FEED A: melted at the panel. Unusable.

    FEED C: breaker scorched; shorts on contact.

    WEST OFFICE: ceiling collapse - every line through it is severed.

    STUDIO A: wiring burned out completely.


    Cause: lightning strike on the mast, fire spread from the experimental rig.

    One occupant unaccounted for. Search suspended.'
  onRead:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 116081437}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: LastSignal.GameFlow.StoryEvents, LastSignal.Runtime
        m_MethodName: AddClue
        m_Mode: 5
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: 
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: 'Fire report: Feed A melted, Feed C shorts. Lines through the west office and Studio A are dead.'
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
